{"id":8405914,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/2648","number":2648,"state":"merged","title":"修复conv2d_v2算子optgroup场景下不使能preload时的groupOptIter重复适配问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/2648","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/2648/issues","body":"## 描述\n对于conv2d_v2算子，optgroup场景下不使能preload时，groupOptIter在算子侧已经适配，计算offset时不需要重复考虑的，本PR为修复当前的重复适配问题。\n修改后实现该场景下groupOptIter始终为0，不会影响该场景下地址偏移的正确计算。\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/1410\n\n## 测试\nRDV通过（273/273）\n\n## 文档更新\n不涉及\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":7,"assignees":[{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68848e03dea8931fab644b6e","login":"zhangyuxiang0119","name":"张喻翔","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/ef/1470773a2803ce17fd42f4bc8760feb28790f49717caa969d7dac783ff8fecf6.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6cc32e","login":"crystalhu","name":"胡碧霞","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/crystalhu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6863449ca39ca35309897c87","login":"lileizheng","name":"lileizheng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/lileizheng","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":true},{"id":"6880ab8479db6d209b3bc340","login":"liubo75","name":"liubo75","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liubo75","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68cad4b54b7553338001454b","login":"zhang-wu","name":"zhang-wu","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhang-wu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false}],"testers":